{"total": 150.75, "lines": [{"cap": "No dia em que as palavras começaram a pesar, eu não consegui levantar da cama. A minha mochila pesava cinquenta quilos.", "start": 0.36, "end": 7.543, "audio_at": 0.3, "dur": 7.422999999999999, "words": [{"text": "No", "start": 0.36, "end": 0.506}, {"text": "dia", "start": 0.518, "end": 0.7}, {"text": "em", "start": 0.712, "end": 0.773}, {"text": "que", "start": 0.785, "end": 0.858}, {"text": "as", "start": 0.87, "end": 0.967}, {"text": "palavras", "start": 0.979, "end": 1.44}, {"text": "começaram", "start": 1.452, "end": 1.974}, {"text": "a", "start": 1.986, "end": 2.023}, {"text": "pesar", "start": 2.035, "end": 2.423}, {"text": "eu", "start": 2.726, "end": 2.811}, {"text": "não", "start": 2.824, "end": 3.006}, {"text": "consegui", "start": 3.018, "end": 3.406}, {"text": "levantar", "start": 3.418, "end": 3.892}, {"text": "da", "start": 3.904, "end": 4.013}, {"text": "cama", "start": 4.025, "end": 4.401}, {"text": "A", "start": 5.237, "end": 5.334}, {"text": "minha", "start": 5.346, "end": 5.565}, {"text": "mochila", "start": 5.577, "end": 6.014}, {"text": "pesava", "start": 6.026, "end": 6.463}, {"text": "cinquenta", "start": 6.475, "end": 7.058}, {"text": "quilos", "start": 7.07, "end": 7.543}]}, {"cap": "A regra era simples. Cada coisa ruim que alguém te diz vira uma pedra na sua mochila. E cada coisa boa… tira uma.", "start": 8.383, "end": 16.622, "audio_at": 8.323, "dur": 8.478833999999999, "words": [{"text": "A", "start": 8.383, "end": 8.504}, {"text": "regra", "start": 8.517, "end": 8.881}, {"text": "era", "start": 8.893, "end": 9.087}, {"text": "simples", "start": 9.099, "end": 9.73}, {"text": "Cada", "start": 10.566, "end": 10.857}, {"text": "coisa", "start": 10.869, "end": 11.221}, {"text": "ruim", "start": 11.233, "end": 11.525}, {"text": "que", "start": 11.537, "end": 11.622}, {"text": "alguém", "start": 11.634, "end": 11.901}, {"text": "te", "start": 11.913, "end": 12.022}, {"text": "diz", "start": 12.034, "end": 12.277}, {"text": "vira", "start": 12.289, "end": 12.496}, {"text": "uma", "start": 12.508, "end": 12.665}, {"text": "pedra", "start": 12.678, "end": 13.042}, {"text": "na", "start": 13.054, "end": 13.151}, {"text": "sua", "start": 13.163, "end": 13.406}, {"text": "mochila", "start": 13.418, "end": 13.94}, {"text": "E", "start": 14.777, "end": 14.899}, {"text": "cada", "start": 14.911, "end": 15.19}, {"text": "coisa", "start": 15.202, "end": 15.517}, {"text": "boa", "start": 15.53, "end": 15.882}, {"text": "tira", "start": 16.076, "end": 16.331}, {"text": "uma", "start": 16.343, "end": 16.622}]}, {"cap": "Na escola, eu entendi de onde vinham as minhas pedras. Quase todas vinham do Lucas.", "start": 17.362, "end": 23.076, "audio_at": 17.302, "dur": 5.954541999999999, "words": [{"text": "Na", "start": 17.362, "end": 17.507}, {"text": "escola", "start": 17.52, "end": 18.017}, {"text": "eu", "start": 18.248, "end": 18.333}, {"text": "entendi", "start": 18.345, "end": 18.806}, {"text": "de", "start": 18.818, "end": 18.915}, {"text": "onde", "start": 18.927, "end": 19.122}, {"text": "vinham", "start": 19.134, "end": 19.437}, {"text": "as", "start": 19.449, "end": 19.583}, {"text": "minhas", "start": 19.595, "end": 19.898}, {"text": "pedras", "start": 19.91, "end": 20.432}, {"text": "Quase", "start": 21.268, "end": 21.729}, {"text": "todas", "start": 21.741, "end": 22.13}, {"text": "vinham", "start": 22.142, "end": 22.421}, {"text": "do", "start": 22.433, "end": 22.542}, {"text": "Lucas", "start": 22.555, "end": 23.076}]}, {"cap": "\"Esquisito.\" Pedra. \"Ninguém quer sentar com você.\" Pedra. \"Cabelo de vassoura.\" Pedra.", "start": 23.716, "end": 32.768, "audio_at": 23.656, "dur": 9.291958, "words": [{"text": "Esquisito", "start": 23.716, "end": 24.42}, {"text": "Pedra", "start": 25.256, "end": 25.717}, {"text": "Ninguém", "start": 26.555, "end": 27.028}, {"text": "quer", "start": 27.04, "end": 27.198}, {"text": "sentar", "start": 27.21, "end": 27.635}, {"text": "com", "start": 27.647, "end": 27.78}, {"text": "você", "start": 27.793, "end": 28.217}, {"text": "Pedra", "start": 29.055, "end": 29.516}, {"text": "Cabelo", "start": 30.353, "end": 30.814}, {"text": "de", "start": 30.827, "end": 30.899}, {"text": "vassoura", "start": 30.912, "end": 31.47}, {"text": "Pedra", "start": 32.307, "end": 32.768}]}, {"cap": "No fim do dia, eu andava curvado, igual um velhinho.", "start": 33.508, "end": 36.894, "audio_at": 33.448, "dur": 3.625916, "words": [{"text": "No", "start": 33.508, "end": 33.678}, {"text": "fim", "start": 33.69, "end": 33.921}, {"text": "do", "start": 33.933, "end": 34.079}, {"text": "dia", "start": 34.091, "end": 34.419}, {"text": "eu", "start": 34.625, "end": 34.77}, {"text": "andava", "start": 34.783, "end": 35.122}, {"text": "curvado", "start": 35.135, "end": 35.681}, {"text": "igual", "start": 35.972, "end": 36.275}, {"text": "um", "start": 36.287, "end": 36.409}, {"text": "velhinho", "start": 36.421, "end": 36.894}]}, {"cap": "Quando eu cheguei em casa, a minha mãe abriu a porta… e eu levei um susto.", "start": 37.634, "end": 41.53, "audio_at": 37.574, "dur": 4.135624999999999, "words": [{"text": "Quando", "start": 37.634, "end": 37.865}, {"text": "eu", "start": 37.877, "end": 37.925}, {"text": "cheguei", "start": 37.938, "end": 38.265}, {"text": "em", "start": 38.277, "end": 38.375}, {"text": "casa", "start": 38.387, "end": 38.775}, {"text": "a", "start": 38.896, "end": 38.969}, {"text": "minha", "start": 38.981, "end": 39.2}, {"text": "mãe", "start": 39.212, "end": 39.418}, {"text": "abriu", "start": 39.43, "end": 39.722}, {"text": "a", "start": 39.734, "end": 39.794}, {"text": "porta", "start": 39.807, "end": 40.243}, {"text": "e", "start": 40.438, "end": 40.51}, {"text": "eu", "start": 40.523, "end": 40.656}, {"text": "levei", "start": 40.668, "end": 40.959}, {"text": "um", "start": 40.972, "end": 41.069}, {"text": "susto", "start": 41.081, "end": 41.53}]}, {"cap": "A mochila dela era gigante. Maior que a minha. Maior que a geladeira.", "start": 42.27, "end": 47.802, "audio_at": 42.21, "dur": 5.772499999999999, "words": [{"text": "A", "start": 42.27, "end": 42.355}, {"text": "mochila", "start": 42.367, "end": 42.828}, {"text": "dela", "start": 42.84, "end": 43.144}, {"text": "era", "start": 43.156, "end": 43.338}, {"text": "gigante", "start": 43.35, "end": 43.92}, {"text": "Maior", "start": 44.756, "end": 45.205}, {"text": "que", "start": 45.217, "end": 45.302}, {"text": "a", "start": 45.315, "end": 45.363}, {"text": "minha", "start": 45.375, "end": 45.703}, {"text": "Maior", "start": 46.54, "end": 47.014}, {"text": "que", "start": 47.026, "end": 47.099}, {"text": "a", "start": 47.111, "end": 47.171}, {"text": "geladeira", "start": 47.183, "end": 47.802}]}, {"cap": "Ela mal conseguia ficar em pé. Mas sorriu e perguntou: \"Como foi a escola, meu amor?\"", "start": 48.542, "end": 54.572, "audio_at": 48.482, "dur": 6.270124999999999, "words": [{"text": "Ela", "start": 48.542, "end": 48.785}, {"text": "mal", "start": 48.797, "end": 49.016}, {"text": "conseguia", "start": 49.028, "end": 49.586}, {"text": "ficar", "start": 49.598, "end": 49.889}, {"text": "em", "start": 49.902, "end": 50.023}, {"text": "pé", "start": 50.035, "end": 50.278}, {"text": "Mas", "start": 51.114, "end": 51.393}, {"text": "sorriu", "start": 51.405, "end": 51.781}, {"text": "e", "start": 51.793, "end": 51.842}, {"text": "perguntou", "start": 51.854, "end": 52.461}, {"text": "Como", "start": 52.74, "end": 53.031}, {"text": "foi", "start": 53.043, "end": 53.274}, {"text": "a", "start": 53.286, "end": 53.335}, {"text": "escola", "start": 53.347, "end": 53.808}, {"text": "meu", "start": 54.063, "end": 54.257}, {"text": "amor", "start": 54.269, "end": 54.572}]}, {"cap": "E eu fiquei pensando: quem é que fala tanta coisa ruim pra minha mãe?", "start": 55.312, "end": 58.953, "audio_at": 55.252, "dur": 3.8807910000000003, "words": [{"text": "E", "start": 55.312, "end": 55.422}, {"text": "eu", "start": 55.434, "end": 55.519}, {"text": "fiquei", "start": 55.531, "end": 55.81}, {"text": "pensando", "start": 55.822, "end": 56.405}, {"text": "quem", "start": 56.611, "end": 56.854}, {"text": "é", "start": 56.866, "end": 56.914}, {"text": "que", "start": 56.927, "end": 57.036}, {"text": "fala", "start": 57.048, "end": 57.363}, {"text": "tanta", "start": 57.376, "end": 57.679}, {"text": "coisa", "start": 57.691, "end": 58.007}, {"text": "ruim", "start": 58.019, "end": 58.262}, {"text": "pra", "start": 58.274, "end": 58.419}, {"text": "minha", "start": 58.431, "end": 58.626}, {"text": "mãe", "start": 58.638, "end": 58.953}]}, {"cap": "Naquela noite, eu descobri. E eu queria nunca ter descoberto.", "start": 59.793, "end": 64.294, "audio_at": 59.733, "dur": 4.740958999999999, "words": [{"text": "Naquela", "start": 59.793, "end": 60.218}, {"text": "noite", "start": 60.23, "end": 60.643}, {"text": "eu", "start": 60.813, "end": 60.946}, {"text": "descobri", "start": 60.958, "end": 61.504}, {"text": "E", "start": 62.34, "end": 62.462}, {"text": "eu", "start": 62.474, "end": 62.619}, {"text": "queria", "start": 62.632, "end": 62.947}, {"text": "nunca", "start": 62.959, "end": 63.384}, {"text": "ter", "start": 63.396, "end": 63.566}, {"text": "descoberto", "start": 63.578, "end": 64.294}]}, {"cap": "De madrugada, eu acordei com a minha mãe sentada na minha cama.", "start": 65.234, "end": 68.632, "audio_at": 65.174, "dur": 3.6380830000000004, "words": [{"text": "De", "start": 65.234, "end": 65.392}, {"text": "madrugada", "start": 65.404, "end": 66.011}, {"text": "eu", "start": 66.266, "end": 66.387}, {"text": "acordei", "start": 66.399, "end": 66.824}, {"text": "com", "start": 66.836, "end": 66.958}, {"text": "a", "start": 66.97, "end": 66.994}, {"text": "minha", "start": 67.006, "end": 67.2}, {"text": "mãe", "start": 67.212, "end": 67.443}, {"text": "sentada", "start": 67.455, "end": 67.965}, {"text": "na", "start": 67.977, "end": 68.062}, {"text": "minha", "start": 68.074, "end": 68.268}, {"text": "cama", "start": 68.28, "end": 68.632}]}, {"cap": "Ela fazia carinho no meu cabelo e falava baixinho: \"Você não é esquisito. Você é o menino mais especial do mundo.\"", "start": 69.272, "end": 76.334, "audio_at": 69.212, "dur": 7.301666999999999, "words": [{"text": "Ela", "start": 69.272, "end": 69.515}, {"text": "fazia", "start": 69.527, "end": 69.831}, {"text": "carinho", "start": 69.843, "end": 70.195}, {"text": "no", "start": 70.207, "end": 70.28}, {"text": "meu", "start": 70.292, "end": 70.413}, {"text": "cabelo", "start": 70.425, "end": 70.838}, {"text": "e", "start": 70.85, "end": 70.874}, {"text": "falava", "start": 70.886, "end": 71.263}, {"text": "baixinho", "start": 71.275, "end": 71.784}, {"text": "Você", "start": 72.124, "end": 72.379}, {"text": "não", "start": 72.391, "end": 72.549}, {"text": "é", "start": 72.561, "end": 72.634}, {"text": "esquisito", "start": 72.646, "end": 73.229}, {"text": "Você", "start": 74.065, "end": 74.453}, {"text": "é", "start": 74.465, "end": 74.526}, {"text": "o", "start": 74.538, "end": 74.574}, {"text": "menino", "start": 74.586, "end": 74.963}, {"text": "mais", "start": 74.975, "end": 75.193}, {"text": "especial", "start": 75.205, "end": 75.861}, {"text": "do", "start": 75.873, "end": 75.958}, {"text": "mundo", "start": 75.97, "end": 76.334}]}, {"cap": "E a cada palavra… uma pedra saía da minha mochila.", "start": 77.074, "end": 80.242, "audio_at": 77.014, "dur": 3.4075, "words": [{"text": "E", "start": 77.074, "end": 77.183}, {"text": "a", "start": 77.195, "end": 77.28}, {"text": "cada", "start": 77.292, "end": 77.572}, {"text": "palavra", "start": 77.584, "end": 78.069}, {"text": "uma", "start": 78.312, "end": 78.542}, {"text": "pedra", "start": 78.555, "end": 78.931}, {"text": "saía", "start": 78.943, "end": 79.368}, {"text": "da", "start": 79.38, "end": 79.477}, {"text": "minha", "start": 79.489, "end": 79.683}, {"text": "mochila", "start": 79.695, "end": 80.242}]}, {"cap": "Mas a pedra não sumia. Ela ia direto pra mochila dela.", "start": 80.981, "end": 85.106, "audio_at": 80.921, "dur": 4.364749999999999, "words": [{"text": "Mas", "start": 80.981, "end": 81.164}, {"text": "a", "start": 81.176, "end": 81.333}, {"text": "pedra", "start": 81.346, "end": 81.673}, {"text": "não", "start": 81.685, "end": 81.916}, {"text": "sumia", "start": 81.928, "end": 82.353}, {"text": "Ela", "start": 83.189, "end": 83.456}, {"text": "ia", "start": 83.468, "end": 83.65}, {"text": "direto", "start": 83.662, "end": 84.111}, {"text": "pra", "start": 84.123, "end": 84.257}, {"text": "mochila", "start": 84.269, "end": 84.73}, {"text": "dela", "start": 84.742, "end": 85.106}]}, {"cap": "Ninguém falava coisa ruim pra minha mãe. Ela tava carregando as minhas pedras. Desde que eu nasci.", "start": 86.046, "end": 92.926, "audio_at": 85.986, "dur": 7.119624999999999, "words": [{"text": "Ninguém", "start": 86.046, "end": 86.471}, {"text": "falava", "start": 86.483, "end": 86.871}, {"text": "coisa", "start": 86.884, "end": 87.236}, {"text": "ruim", "start": 87.248, "end": 87.527}, {"text": "pra", "start": 87.539, "end": 87.672}, {"text": "minha", "start": 87.685, "end": 87.867}, {"text": "mãe", "start": 87.879, "end": 88.17}, {"text": "Ela", "start": 89.006, "end": 89.261}, {"text": "tava", "start": 89.273, "end": 89.516}, {"text": "carregando", "start": 89.528, "end": 90.025}, {"text": "as", "start": 90.037, "end": 90.147}, {"text": "minhas", "start": 90.159, "end": 90.462}, {"text": "pedras", "start": 90.474, "end": 91.021}, {"text": "Desde", "start": 91.858, "end": 92.307}, {"text": "que", "start": 92.319, "end": 92.392}, {"text": "eu", "start": 92.404, "end": 92.489}, {"text": "nasci", "start": 92.501, "end": 92.926}]}, {"cap": "Toda vez que alguém me machucava, ela pegava a dor pra ela. E nunca me contou.", "start": 93.766, "end": 98.983, "audio_at": 93.706, "dur": 5.456999999999999, "words": [{"text": "Toda", "start": 93.766, "end": 94.033}, {"text": "vez", "start": 94.045, "end": 94.324}, {"text": "que", "start": 94.336, "end": 94.397}, {"text": "alguém", "start": 94.409, "end": 94.64}, {"text": "me", "start": 94.652, "end": 94.725}, {"text": "machucava", "start": 94.737, "end": 95.392}, {"text": "ela", "start": 95.586, "end": 95.78}, {"text": "pegava", "start": 95.793, "end": 96.169}, {"text": "a", "start": 96.181, "end": 96.217}, {"text": "dor", "start": 96.229, "end": 96.46}, {"text": "pra", "start": 96.472, "end": 96.666}, {"text": "ela", "start": 96.678, "end": 96.994}, {"text": "E", "start": 97.83, "end": 97.951}, {"text": "nunca", "start": 97.963, "end": 98.388}, {"text": "me", "start": 98.4, "end": 98.497}, {"text": "contou", "start": 98.51, "end": 98.983}]}, {"cap": "Eu não aguentei. Abracei ela e disse: \"Mãe, você é a pessoa mais forte que eu conheço.\"", "start": 99.923, "end": 105.807, "audio_at": 99.863, "dur": 6.124458999999999, "words": [{"text": "Eu", "start": 99.923, "end": 100.093}, {"text": "não", "start": 100.105, "end": 100.348}, {"text": "aguentei", "start": 100.36, "end": 100.894}, {"text": "Abracei", "start": 101.73, "end": 102.191}, {"text": "ela", "start": 102.203, "end": 102.349}, {"text": "e", "start": 102.361, "end": 102.397}, {"text": "disse", "start": 102.409, "end": 102.785}, {"text": "Mãe", "start": 103.125, "end": 103.356}, {"text": "você", "start": 103.696, "end": 104.023}, {"text": "é", "start": 104.035, "end": 104.12}, {"text": "a", "start": 104.133, "end": 104.169}, {"text": "pessoa", "start": 104.181, "end": 104.509}, {"text": "mais", "start": 104.521, "end": 104.715}, {"text": "forte", "start": 104.727, "end": 105.103}, {"text": "que", "start": 105.116, "end": 105.176}, {"text": "eu", "start": 105.188, "end": 105.249}, {"text": "conheço", "start": 105.261, "end": 105.807}]}, {"cap": "E uma pedra saiu da mochila dela.", "start": 106.547, "end": 108.574, "audio_at": 106.487, "dur": 2.2667080000000004, "words": [{"text": "E", "start": 106.547, "end": 106.644}, {"text": "uma", "start": 106.657, "end": 106.851}, {"text": "pedra", "start": 106.863, "end": 107.263}, {"text": "saiu", "start": 107.276, "end": 107.627}, {"text": "da", "start": 107.64, "end": 107.725}, {"text": "mochila", "start": 107.737, "end": 108.186}, {"text": "dela", "start": 108.198, "end": 108.574}]}, {"cap": "\"Obrigado por tudo.\" Outra pedra. \"Eu te amo.\" Outra.", "start": 109.314, "end": 114.932, "audio_at": 109.254, "dur": 5.857499999999999, "words": [{"text": "Obrigado", "start": 109.314, "end": 109.945}, {"text": "por", "start": 109.957, "end": 110.139}, {"text": "tudo", "start": 110.151, "end": 110.503}, {"text": "Outra", "start": 111.339, "end": 111.703}, {"text": "pedra", "start": 111.716, "end": 112.14}, {"text": "Eu", "start": 112.978, "end": 113.148}, {"text": "te", "start": 113.16, "end": 113.317}, {"text": "amo", "start": 113.33, "end": 113.633}, {"text": "Outra", "start": 114.47, "end": 114.932}]}, {"cap": "A minha mochila foi ficando pesada. Mas eu nunca me senti tão leve.", "start": 115.672, "end": 120.197, "audio_at": 115.612, "dur": 4.765249999999999, "words": [{"text": "A", "start": 115.672, "end": 115.769}, {"text": "minha", "start": 115.781, "end": 115.963}, {"text": "mochila", "start": 115.975, "end": 116.436}, {"text": "foi", "start": 116.448, "end": 116.582}, {"text": "ficando", "start": 116.594, "end": 117.007}, {"text": "pesada", "start": 117.019, "end": 117.54}, {"text": "Mas", "start": 118.376, "end": 118.571}, {"text": "eu", "start": 118.583, "end": 118.801}, {"text": "nunca", "start": 118.813, "end": 119.153}, {"text": "me", "start": 119.165, "end": 119.25}, {"text": "senti", "start": 119.262, "end": 119.639}, {"text": "tão", "start": 119.651, "end": 119.833}, {"text": "leve", "start": 119.845, "end": 120.197}]}, {"cap": "Hoje, a gente divide as pedras. Ela tira as minhas, eu tiro as dela. E ninguém carrega nada sozinho.", "start": 121.037, "end": 128.56, "audio_at": 120.977, "dur": 7.762833, "words": [{"text": "Hoje", "start": 121.037, "end": 121.413}, {"text": "a", "start": 121.534, "end": 121.595}, {"text": "gente", "start": 121.607, "end": 121.911}, {"text": "divide", "start": 121.923, "end": 122.275}, {"text": "as", "start": 122.287, "end": 122.396}, {"text": "pedras", "start": 122.408, "end": 122.918}, {"text": "Ela", "start": 123.754, "end": 124.021}, {"text": "tira", "start": 124.033, "end": 124.3}, {"text": "as", "start": 124.312, "end": 124.433}, {"text": "minhas", "start": 124.446, "end": 124.81}, {"text": "eu", "start": 125.016, "end": 125.125}, {"text": "tiro", "start": 125.137, "end": 125.404}, {"text": "as", "start": 125.416, "end": 125.538}, {"text": "dela", "start": 125.55, "end": 125.926}, {"text": "E", "start": 126.764, "end": 126.861}, {"text": "ninguém", "start": 126.873, "end": 127.212}, {"text": "carrega", "start": 127.225, "end": 127.662}, {"text": "nada", "start": 127.674, "end": 127.953}, {"text": "sozinho", "start": 127.965, "end": 128.56}]}, {"cap": "Ah… e o Lucas? Ontem, eu vi a mochila dele pela primeira vez. Era a mais pesada da escola.", "start": 129.5, "end": 136.768, "audio_at": 129.44, "dur": 7.5079579999999995, "words": [{"text": "Ah", "start": 129.5, "end": 129.767}, {"text": "e", "start": 130.058, "end": 130.179}, {"text": "o", "start": 130.191, "end": 130.24}, {"text": "Lucas", "start": 130.252, "end": 130.81}, {"text": "Ontem", "start": 131.646, "end": 132.035}, {"text": "eu", "start": 132.302, "end": 132.411}, {"text": "vi", "start": 132.423, "end": 132.544}, {"text": "a", "start": 132.556, "end": 132.605}, {"text": "mochila", "start": 132.617, "end": 133.054}, {"text": "dele", "start": 133.066, "end": 133.345}, {"text": "pela", "start": 133.357, "end": 133.552}, {"text": "primeira", "start": 133.564, "end": 133.928}, {"text": "vez", "start": 133.94, "end": 134.328}, {"text": "Era", "start": 135.166, "end": 135.372}, {"text": "a", "start": 135.384, "end": 135.408}, {"text": "mais", "start": 135.42, "end": 135.7}, {"text": "pesada", "start": 135.712, "end": 136.185}, {"text": "da", "start": 136.197, "end": 136.27}, {"text": "escola", "start": 136.282, "end": 136.768}]}, {"cap": "Eu cheguei perto e disse: \"Bom dia, Lucas.\" E pela primeira vez… ele sorriu.", "start": 137.608, "end": 143.431, "audio_at": 137.548, "dur": 6.06375, "words": [{"text": "Eu", "start": 137.608, "end": 137.765}, {"text": "cheguei", "start": 137.777, "end": 138.117}, {"text": "perto", "start": 138.129, "end": 138.457}, {"text": "e", "start": 138.469, "end": 138.506}, {"text": "disse", "start": 138.518, "end": 138.906}, {"text": "Bom", "start": 139.173, "end": 139.428}, {"text": "dia", "start": 139.44, "end": 139.731}, {"text": "Lucas", "start": 139.986, "end": 140.484}, {"text": "E", "start": 141.32, "end": 141.429}, {"text": "pela", "start": 141.441, "end": 141.696}, {"text": "primeira", "start": 141.708, "end": 142.096}, {"text": "vez", "start": 142.109, "end": 142.485}, {"text": "ele", "start": 142.715, "end": 142.934}, {"text": "sorriu", "start": 142.946, "end": 143.431}]}, {"cap": "E você? Quem carrega as suas pedras? Comenta o nome dessa pessoa.", "start": 144.371, "end": 149.77, "audio_at": 144.311, "dur": 5.639041999999999, "words": [{"text": "E", "start": 144.371, "end": 144.493}, {"text": "você", "start": 144.505, "end": 144.93}, {"text": "Quem", "start": 145.765, "end": 145.972}, {"text": "carrega", "start": 145.984, "end": 146.421}, {"text": "as", "start": 146.433, "end": 146.53}, {"text": "suas", "start": 146.542, "end": 146.785}, {"text": "pedras", "start": 146.797, "end": 147.343}, {"text": "Comenta", "start": 148.181, "end": 148.642}, {"text": "o", "start": 148.654, "end": 148.678}, {"text": "nome", "start": 148.69, "end": 148.957}, {"text": "dessa", "start": 148.969, "end": 149.248}, {"text": "pessoa", "start": 149.261, "end": 149.77}]}]}